00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:51.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
I totally relate
to what you were just saying

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:55.441 size:81% position:41%
Like, good, you know?
I'm good with just me.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:57.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
