I should probably

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
not be left alone to my ow
devices much longer, you know?

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-I don't know how healthy it i

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:05.552 line:92%
to just do a show for yourself

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:09.689
-Well, it's -- it's not --
Still doing it for people.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-I just feel as though at leas

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:15.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
