00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:27.106 line:92%
Now, one of the things --

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:29.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
you were ready a little bi
for no audience,

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
