00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:53.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were "24" fans
good stand-up fans?

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:58.531
-The first time I went on th
road proper, "24" was just -

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:02.535 size:88% position:44%
